      ":question/id": "9352349d-64e0-5437-9d72-7e7f7e571064",
      ":question/math-academy-id": "e-4405",
      ":question/problem": "Let\n![](images/03/035755bae569c8c9323112891f959076dd727d3ef40ba66c6c40dadf5ddc8f84.png)\nand\n![](images/e5/e53c9ba3bb64b81e44f8f4f49ac77408b7db6ee458be3d43b687d9ed8897ad59.png)\nWhat are the dimensions of $BA?$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We notice that $A$ is a $4 \\times 2$ matrix and $B$ is a $2 \\times 4$ matrix. \n\nThere are $4$ columns in $B$ and $4$ rows in $A.$ Since the number of columns in $B$ equals the number of rows in $A,$ the matrices $B$ and $A$ are conformable for multiplication. \n\nThe product $BA$ has dimensions $2 \\times 2\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\underset{\\bbox[lightgray, 2pt]{2} \\times \\color{green}{\\fbox{4}}}{B} \\underset{\\color{green}\\checkmark}{\\times} \\underset{{\\color{green}\\fbox{4}} \\times \\bbox[lightgray, 2pt]{2}}{A} = \n\t\\underset{\\bbox[lightgray, 2pt]{2} \\times \\bbox[lightgray, 2pt]{2}}{BA}\n$$"
    },
